{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030080011762-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030124214\"/><p>油麻地有人遇襲。今晨(30日)7時37分，一對夫妻在彌敦道458號美景大廈一單位疑因離婚問題發生爭執，期間妻子情緒激動，以玻璃樽襲擊丈夫頭部。警員到場經初步調查，以涉嫌「襲擊他人造成身體傷害」拘捕一名38歲女子，頭部流血紅腫清醒的丈夫則由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:05:48.667081+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T00:00:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:45.639139+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:00:02.551357+00:00","content_hash":"6cd0e22f24cc454dc55928b2b8a129c1c9d2824bd98f97bfef9ab6a85c88883c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}